          "_name": "features7",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features7\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <!---->\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Cost\" name=\"showCost\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#45b034\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/fecaaf72d702dac85fce3890eaebe4d3-640x394.png\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#bed3f9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid' : fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"row align-items-center\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                        <a href=\"https://20358gmlumsk1o8vqgmk2kiids.hop.clickbank.net\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/product-zencortex.webp\" alt=\"ZenCortex \"></a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-lg\">\n                    <div class=\"text-box\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-title\"><b>Maintain Your Hearing Health and Sharpness of Mind with ZenCortex's Herbal Formulation</b></h5>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .cost, .mbr-section-btn\">ZenCortex is an oral supplement formulated for adults who want to promote good hearing and brain wellness within their diet. The herbal-like formulation includes compounds like grapeseed, green tea, Panax ginseng, astragalus, and maca root. These compounds are known to have biological activities such as antioxidant capacity and overall wellness maintenance; however, the efficacy of the full formulation of ZenCortex as a supplement to improve hearing health has not been clinically proven. Learning about its ingredients and benefits, as well as safety considerations, can aid consumers in making wise choices. ZenCortex is to augment, but not replace, proper hearing care.<br><br>✅ Botanical-Inspired Dietary Supplement\n<br>✅ Features Grape Seed and Green Tea\n<br>✅ Includes Panax Ginseng and Astragalus\n<br>✅ Supports a Daily Wellness Routine\n<br>✅ Designed for Hearing and Cognitive Wellness<br><br><b>Try&nbsp;ZenCortex&nbsp;&nbsp;For Over 70% OFF Today!&nbsp;</b><br></p>\n                        <div class=\"cost\" mbr-if=\"showCost\">\n                            <span mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" class=\"currentcost mbr-fonts-style pr-2\" data-app-selector=\".currentcost\">$69</span>\n                            <span mbr-text mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" class=\"oldcost mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".oldcost\"></span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"https://20358gmlumsk1o8vqgmk2kiids.hop.clickbank.net\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Buy Now $49/Bottel</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
