          "_name": "content4",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><div><b>ZenCortex™ </b>is marketed as a dietary supplement designed to support hearing wellness, auditory health, and overall well-being. Its formula features a combination of botanical extracts, amino acids, and other compounds. Some ingredients have been studied for antioxidant properties and general health benefits, but scientific evidence has not established that ZenCortex itself improves hearing or treats tinnitus.</div><div><b><br></b></div><div><div><b>✅Supports Everyday Hearing Wellness –</b>&nbsp;ZenCortex is promoted for adults interested in maintaining their auditory wellness as part of a daily health routine. Its botanical ingredients are included to provide nutritional support, although there is insufficient clinical evidence to confirm that this supplement improves hearing sensitivity or reverses hearing loss.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Provides Antioxidant Support– </b>Ingredients such as grape seed extract and green tea extract contain naturally occurring compounds with antioxidant properties. Antioxidants help protect cells from oxidative stress. However, antioxidant activity alone does not demonstrate that a supplement can prevent damage to the auditory system or restore hearing.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Supports General Cognitive Wellness –</b>&nbsp;Panax ginseng is a botanical ingredient that has been studied for its potential effects on cognitive performance and mental fatigue. ZenCortex includes this ingredient as part of its broader wellness formula. Its specific effects on concentration or cognitive performance when taken in ZenCortex have not been established.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><b>✅Includes Traditional Botanical Ingredients– </b>ZenCortex contains several plants used in traditional herbal preparations, including astragalus, maca, and Gymnema sylvestre. These ingredients have been investigated for different biological properties. Their traditional use may interest consumers looking for botanical supplements, but it does not guarantee a particular health outcome.</div></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Helps Complement a Balanced Wellness Routine –</b>&nbsp;A supplement may be one component of a broader approach to well-being. Adequate sleep, regular physical activity, balanced nutrition, and stress management all contribute to general health. ZenCortex should be viewed as a potential supplement to healthy habits rather than a replacement for them.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Provides Amino Acids for General Body Functions –</b>&nbsp;The product's published ingredient information lists amino acids such as L-arginine, L-carnitine, and L-tyrosine. Amino acids participate in various physiological processes, including protein metabolism and normal cellular functions. However, their presence in the formula does not establish a direct benefit for hearing or tinnitus.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Offers a Blend of Botanical Extracts –&nbsp; &nbsp;</b>ZenCortex combines several botanical ingredients in a single formula. This may appeal to people who prefer a multi-ingredient supplement rather than purchasing individual products. Because the formula includes a proprietary blend, however, the individual amounts of many ingredients may not be disclosed, making it difficult to evaluate their effectiveness and safety.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Supports Interest in Cellular Health –</b>&nbsp;Plant-derived compounds found in grape seed and green tea extracts have been researched for their antioxidant activity and possible effects on cellular processes. These areas of research are scientifically interesting, but evidence from laboratory or ingredient-specific studies cannot establish that ZenCortex provides measurable benefits in people.</span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><br></span></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Provides a Convenient Supplement Option –</b>&nbsp;ZenCortex is marketed in a liquid supplement format, which may be convenient for adults who prefer liquids to tablets or capsules. Consumers should follow the actual product label for serving instructions and check the ingredients carefully before use.</span></div></div><br><div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>✅Encourages a Proactive Approach to Auditory Health –</b>&nbsp;Looking after hearing involves protecting the ears from excessive noise, using appropriate hearing protection, and seeking professional assessment when changes occur. ZenCortex may appeal to consumers exploring supplements for auditory wellness, but it should not replace hearing tests, hearing aids, or medical treatment when needed.</span></div></div><div><br></div></h2>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
